("v160", "scalar", "A trailer rendered entirely from code: a sky computed pixel by pixel, lights that leave trails, the commandments set in type, and a drone synthesised from sine waves and noise. No cameras, no stock footage, no generated video — every frame can be rendered again from the site’s own source.")
